# 🛡️ SENTINEL: Multi-Agent Financial & Compliance Risk System - PHASE 1

**SENTINEL** is an autonomous multi-agent AI framework built with **LangGraph**, **LangChain**, and **Groq (Llama 3.3 70B)**. It automates corporate risk analysis by dispatching specialized sub-agents to gather financial metrics and live web intelligence, evaluates risk levels, and enforces strict **Human-in-the-Loop governance** before issuing final approval reports.

---

## 📸 How It Works

```text
                  ┌────────────────────────┐
                  │        START           │
                  └───────────┬────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                  ┌────────────────────────┐
                  │ 📈 Financial Analyst   │  (Pulls Market Cap, Debt, Cashflow via yfinance)
                  └───────────┬────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                  ┌────────────────────────┐
                  │ 🌐 OSINT / News Agent  │  (Scrapes Web & Lawsuit News via DuckDuckGo)
                  └───────────┬────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                  ┌────────────────────────┐
                  │  👔 Supervisor Node    │  (Evaluates Risk & Sets LOW / ELEVATED)
                  └───────────┬────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                  ⏸️ 🛑 Human Checkpoint 🛑  <-- LangGraph pauses workflow here!
                              │
                 ┌────────────┴────────────┐
                 │ Human Decision?         │
                 └──────┬────────────┬─────┘
          (APPROVED)    │            │    (REJECTED)
                        ▼            ▼
                  ┌──────────┐  ┌───────────┐
                  │ Summary  │  │ Cancelled │
                  └────┬─────┘  └─────┬─────┘
                       │              │
                       └──────┬───────┘
                              ▼
                           [ END ]
```
---
# ✨ Key Features
📈 Live Financial Intelligence: Fetches real-time stock quotes, valuation metrics, P/E ratios, and debt data without paid API keys (yfinance).

🌐 Web OSINT Scraping: Scrapes recent controversies, lawsuits, and legal exposure snippets via DuckDuckGo (ddgs).

👔 Automated Risk Assessment: Evaluates aggregated data and dynamically flags targets with an ELEVATED or LOW risk rating.

🛑 Human-in-the-Loop Governance: Built-in breakpoint state persistence using LangGraph checkpointers (MemorySaver). The system pauses automatically before approval, awaiting human authorization to resume or terminate.

⚡ Blazing Fast Execution: Powered by Groq's high-speed Llama 3.3 70B inference engine.

# 📂 Project Structure
```text
sentinel/
├── .env                       # Local API keys (ignored by git)
├── pyproject.toml             # Project dependencies and setup
├── test_tools.py              # Standalone tool integration test
├── test_graph.py              # LangGraph workflow test script
└── src/
    └── sentinel/
        ├── tools/
        │   ├── finance.py     # Yahoo Finance extraction tool
        │   └── osint.py       # DuckDuckGo search tool
        └── graph/
            ├── state.py       # Shared central GraphState schema & reducers
            ├── nodes.py       # Agent worker nodes & summary generators
            └── workflow.py    # StateGraph definition & checkpoint routing
```

# 🛠️ Prerequisites
Python 3.10+

uv Package Manager (Fast Python package manager)

Groq API Key (Free from (GROQ)[console.groq.com])

---

# 🚀 Quickstart Guide
## 1️⃣ Clone the Repository & Install Dependencies
```bash
git clone [https://github.com/aribi-ahmed/sentinel.git](https://github.com/aribi-ahmed/sentinel.git)
cd sentinel
```

### Install all dependencies using uv
```bash
uv sync
```
## 2️⃣ Configure Environment Variables
Create a .env file in the root directory:

```
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
```
## 3️⃣ Test Individual Tools
Verify that Yahoo Finance, DuckDuckGo, and Groq LLM integration work on your machine:

```bash
uv run python test_tools.py
```
## 4️⃣ Run the Complete Agent Workflow
Run the full state workflow with human-in-the-loop pausing and resuming:

```bash
uv run python test_graph.py
```
